{"seq":6,"at":"2026-11-15T07:15:32.025Z","why":"The roles and constructions are the game's blocks: pieces of pieces.json, the strip editor's, each marking what the syntax domain's vocabulary (version 2) gives; levels, trays and concepts name them by their type","by":"cli","ops":[{"op":"piece.add","piece":"subj","data":{"editor":"strip","name":{"zh":"主语"},"desc":{"zh":"句子说的是谁、是什么。标出它的名词短语：修饰成分都折起来以后，剩下的那几个词。"},"icon":"Rows3","mark":"subj"}},{"op":"piece.add","piece":"verb","data":{"editor":"strip","name":{"zh":"谓语"},"desc":{"zh":"主语做什么、怎么样：整个动词词组，连同助动词（has been shown）。"},"icon":"Rows3","mark":"verb"}},{"op":"piece.add","piece":"obj","data":{"editor":"strip","name":{"zh":"宾语"},"desc":{"zh":"动作落到的东西，跟在谓语后面的名词短语。"},"icon":"Rows3","mark":"obj"}},{"op":"piece.add","piece":"comp","data":{"editor":"strip","name":{"zh":"表语"},"desc":{"zh":"跟在 be 这类系动词后面、说明主语是什么或怎么样的成分。"},"icon":"Rows3","mark":"comp"}},{"op":"piece.add","piece":"pp","data":{"editor":"strip","name":{"zh":"介词短语"},"desc":{"zh":"介词开头的一串词（of the model、on a single GPU），整块修饰一个词。折起来，挂到它修饰的词上。"},"icon":"CornerDownRight","mark":"pp"}},{"op":"piece.add","piece":"rel","data":{"editor":"strip","name":{"zh":"定语从句"},"desc":{"zh":"跟在名词后面、自带主语和谓语的小句（that we propose、which has seven billion parameters）。折起来，挂到它修饰的词上。"},"icon":"Quote","mark":"rel"}},{"op":"level.set","level":"1-1","path":"adds","value":["subj","verb","obj"]},{"op":"level.set","level":"1-5","path":"adds","value":["comp"]},{"op":"game.set","path":"trays","value":{"main":["subj","verb","obj","pp","comp","rel"]}},{"op":"game.set","path":"concept","value":{"subj":"skeleton","verb":"skeleton","obj":"skeleton","comp":"skeleton"}},{"op":"game.set","path":"vocabulary","value":2},{"op":"i18n.set","lang":"en","from":"句子说的是谁、是什么。标出它的名词短语：修饰成分都折起来以后，剩下的那几个词。","to":"Who or what the sentence is about. Mark its noun phrase: the words left once its modifiers are folded."},{"op":"i18n.set","lang":"en","from":"主语做什么、怎么样：整个动词词组，连同助动词（has been shown）。","to":"What the subject does or i